//RS //! D-COMPUTE-KERNEL-SURFACE1=B: the conservative safe-kernel proof.
//RS //!
//RS //! A marker is not a proof. This pass accepts only read-only, effect-free
//RS //! expression kernels whose safety obligations are either structural or
//RS //! delegated to the checked Core compute family. Flat and projected accesses,
//RS //! masked additions, first-match exits, and fixed-order reductions are admitted
//RS //! only when their exact loop shape is proven; calls, aliases, and unsupported
//RS //! operations remain rejected until their proof facts exist.
